{
  "name": "Pricing 06: cópia externa noturna",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Cópia externa (camada 3)\nExporta banco e arquivos, cifra e grava no destino do próprio cliente, fora do provedor. Exige no servidor do n8n: o repositório, pg_dump e as variáveis SUPABASE_DB_URL, COPIA_SENHA, COPIA_DESTINO.\n\nO teste de restauração é trimestral e manual: pnpm --filter @pricing/ferramentas restauracao.",
        "height": 200,
        "width": 420
      },
      "id": "1efe38e0-a872-4f5b-9d50-dcd9f29edc91",
      "name": "Leia-me",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -460,
        -260
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "days",
              "daysInterval": 1,
              "triggerAtHour": 2
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "a37823dd-c5e7-496f-ae25-9f5fa2151c53",
      "name": "Toda noite às 2h",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        -460,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "command": "=cd {{ $env.PRICING_REPO_DIR }} && pnpm --silent --filter @pricing/ferramentas copia -- --registrar"
      },
      "id": "b8c65d08-7050-4e70-beee-772c72fd2ba6",
      "name": "Exportar, cifrar e gravar",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.executeCommand",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -240,
        0
      ],
      "continueOnFail": true
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "typeValidation": "loose"
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "dd8dc501-176c-4a29-b244-4a46edadb843",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.exitCode !== 0 }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "true",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "fa10c7f1-1863-42fe-afd7-36124bd0051c",
      "name": "Falhou?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        -20,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "fromEmail": "={{ $env.PRICING_EMAIL_REMETENTE }}",
        "toEmail": "={{ $env.PRICING_EMAIL_ALERTA }}",
        "subject": "FALHA na cópia externa do sistema de pricing",
        "emailFormat": "text",
        "text": "={{ \"A cópia externa noturna falhou.\\n\\n\" + ($json.stderr || $json.stdout || \"sem saída\") }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "4227da82-6cef-4d9f-8e8a-19df345ae7db",
      "name": "Alertar falha de backup",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.emailSend",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [
        200,
        -100
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "smtp": {
          "id": "CONFIGURE",
          "name": "SMTP do cliente"
        }
      }
    }
  ],
